    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d766">

                <pb facs="0859" n="771" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg771"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. McCormick.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-10-04"><hi rendition="#italic">October 4,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Transmit following telegram to Greener, Vladivostok: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Ascertain and report what disposition was made of consignment of 26
                            pieces machinery consigned to order Post &amp; Co., A. Weston, Yokohama,
                            shipped on S. S. <hi rendition="#italic">Calchas.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
